214:- **Determinism preserved.** Pure factors are replayable in the evaluation harness; no hidden state, no implicit DB reads.
215:- **Composers stay expressive.** Each composer keeps its own combinator — geometric mean, lifecycle weighting, whatever future surfaces need — without being forced into a shared scale.
