364:- `intelligence_claims` does not exist yet — confirmed. [DOS-7](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-7) creates it.
366:- Agent trust ledger as a separate table is fine; the per-claim-type fan-out (max ~10 agents × ~20 claim types = 200 rows) is trivial storage.
