   250	The implementation plan adds a **Phase 0** that precedes everything in the original §1–8:
   251	
   252	- **Phase 0 (v1.4.0):** Audit the existing factor math; reconcile formula drift between health scoring and signal fusion; consolidate into `scoring::factors`; leave current call sites untouched but add the new module alongside.
