.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-7.log:983:8:**Consumed by:** [DOS-7](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-7) (`intelligence_claims.actor` column, tombstones), [DOS-241](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-241) (enrichment refactor design)
