.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-7.log:4543:41:3. **`intelligence.json` file** in each entity directory — authoritative `IntelligenceJson` Rust type (`intelligence/io.rs`), atomic-written. Holds `ItemSource` attribution per item, `DismissedItem` tombstones, `UserEdit` records, `ConsistencyFinding` records — much richer than the SQLite columns.
